{"ref":"BDB, פְּלַטְיָ֫הוּ","hw":"פְּלַטְיָ֫הוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלַטְיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלַטְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Φαλτιας, Φαλεττι(α), etc.:—<br><strong>1.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָהוּ</span>, a prince of people <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 11:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.11.1\">Ez 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 11:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.11.13\">13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>, grandson of Zerub. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.21\">1 Ch 3:21</a>, perhaps = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.23\">Ne 10:23</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>, Simeonite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.42\">1 Ch 4:42</a>.","next":"BDB, יַפְלֵט²","prev":"BDB, פַּלְטִיאֵל"}